WEBVTT

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.980
SWORD GAI

00:01:14.570 --> 00:01:17.990
Long ago, in a village near
the Mediterranean Sea,

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:20.580
lived a young man named Kanata.

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:25.870
He was the offspring
of a human father and a fairy mother,

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:31.170
and was born with knowledge
and strength beyond that of a human.

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:37.930
When Kanata turned 18,
his mother gave him the Halbert,

00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:40.510
an ancient weapon
of the fairy world, and said,

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:45.560
"When used for justice,
it will give its bearer great power."

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:51.440
"But if used for evil,
it will bring its bearer great disaster."

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:54.280
Kanata went to the battlefield,

00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:58.360
and held true to his mother's words,
using the Halbert only for justice.

00:01:59.070 --> 00:02:02.780
To protect the village,
he singlehandedly defeated 100 enemies,

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:04.950
and became a hero.

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:08.750
But when he returned to the village,

00:02:09.670 --> 00:02:15.960
he found that his lover, Sara,
married a young doctor while he was away.

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:23.760
Betrayed by his lover,
he went mad with jealousy.

00:02:23.850 --> 00:02:26.930
He chased after the two
and killed them with the Halbert.

00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:30.060
The Halbert turned crimson,

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:33.320
and began to attack
one innocent after another.

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:42.200
Kanata killed the villagers
as if controlled by the Halbert.

00:02:43.910 --> 00:02:46.750
And ultimately,
he even killed his parents.

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:55.590
In the end he died of exhaustion,

00:02:55.670 --> 00:03:00.050
but until he died
the Halbert continued its slaughter.

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:07.600
And you're going to bring me
this legendary weapon.

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:16.110
Your target is the real estate company,
Sekiya Group.

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:20.570
We recently received information
that the CEO, Shuntaro Sekiya,

00:03:20.650 --> 00:03:23.280
purchased the weapon
from its wealthy foreign owner.

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:28.910
Agent Mina Hiraya has already infiltrated
the organization as his secretary.

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:34.540
Mr. Sekiya is ill, so he wanted
a secretary with nurse training.

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:38.170
That's how she was able to get hired.

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:40.880
<i>Mina.</i>

00:03:42.340 --> 00:03:44.390
Excuse me, is Mr. Sekiya in?

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:46.560
Do you have an appointment?

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:51.100
Tell him I'm from I Miss You Inc.,
and he'll know what I'm here for.

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:52.980
One moment, please.

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:56.150
<i>I Miss You?</i>

00:04:09.950 --> 00:04:14.250
<i>I thought you were
<i>just a hallucination of mine.</i></i>

00:04:16.710 --> 00:04:19.590
<i>You haven't changed
<i>despite all the decades.</i></i>

00:04:20.010 --> 00:04:26.090
<i>I was left behind
<i>and got old all alone, but...</i></i>

00:04:31.310 --> 00:04:33.480
What, you're not hungry?

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:36.400
I thought we were heading
to the Shoshidai.

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:42.360
It's been a while since I've been outside.
I want to enjoy it a little.

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:46.910
Once you go to sleep, who knows
how long it'll be before you wake up.

00:04:47.740 --> 00:04:50.620
If you have plans, you should do them now.

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:53.910
I don't have anything like that.

00:04:55.170 --> 00:04:57.380
Don't say that. Look over there.

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:05.300
This scenery could be completely different
the next time you come here.

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:13.350
We constantly undergo cold sleep,
so we don't get to enjoy life like others.

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:19.440
All we're allowed
is to remember what we see now.

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:22.820
Why remember?

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:28.490
Because it's the only way for us
to exist in this world,

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:32.490
and not just as a hallucination.

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:38.330
Gai, what have you seen in your life?

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:44.090
I missed you!

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:48.930
We'll get that Guinness record
another time, okay?

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:52.260
There's a floor reserved for executives
in the basement.

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:55.270
The Halbert is being kept there in a safe.

00:05:55.640 --> 00:05:59.310
The duct leading there connects
to a men's room in the basement.

00:06:00.110 --> 00:06:05.190
Inside you'll find the elevator key,
a map and the password to the safe.

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:07.700
Roger. Good work.

00:06:09.070 --> 00:06:11.910
Be careful. Security's tight.

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:14.120
<i>Please authorize key.</i>

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:20.460
Miki, you were dating Hiraya, huh?

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:22.920
Yeah. Keep it quiet.

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:26.090
We're not allowed
to have at-work relationships.

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:30.430
Yeah. That's incredible, though,
that she infiltrated the place by herself.

00:06:30.760 --> 00:06:32.390
Don't you dare fall in love.

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:36.270
Don't worry. She's not my type.

00:06:36.350 --> 00:06:37.890
That alone pisses me off.

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:46.360
So, this area's off limits to the public?

00:06:46.690 --> 00:06:49.240
Actually, I have an idea.

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:05.550
You're sure they can't see us?

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:10.300
My Azoth Sword still contains
the devil sealed by Paracelsus.

00:07:11.090 --> 00:07:14.100
I'm using its power
to surround us with darkness.

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:17.350
Wow. Nice job, Marcus.

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:21.310
Hurry.

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:22.900
R-Right.

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:32.950
Huh? Did you say something?

00:07:33.240 --> 00:07:36.080
I hate filthy places like this.

00:07:36.740 --> 00:07:40.120
Whenever a friend came over
I'd always clean after they left.

00:07:40.210 --> 00:07:42.670
So how'd someone like me end up here?

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:44.420
Don't say that.

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:46.590
Look, we're here.

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:51.970
Let's get out of here.
I can't take it any more.

00:07:52.050 --> 00:07:54.340
It stinks, it's filthy, it's disgusting!

00:07:56.050 --> 00:07:57.510
Hey, get off me!

00:07:58.220 --> 00:07:59.720
That's kind of creepy!

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:02.850
Don't say that! H-Hurry!

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:10.690
Okay, let's say hello
to our legendary weapon.

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:14.160
What's wrong?

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:19.370
We opened the safe to find another.
Looks like we need a second password.

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:20.660
<i>But I...</i>

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:22.710
Any ideas, Mina?

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:28.460
<i>Authorization error.</i>

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:31.380
<i>Unregistered person recognized.</i>

00:08:32.090 --> 00:08:33.840
<i>Beginning gas emission.</i>

00:08:36.260 --> 00:08:37.260
S-Sorry!

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:39.720
<i>Naoki, what's wrong?</i>

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:43.980
We may be in a pinch.

00:08:44.600 --> 00:08:46.690
Can you look for anything promising?

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:47.980
Hurry!

00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:50.530
Hold on, hold on!

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:55.740
Something that looks like a password...

00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:00.660
No luck.

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:03.460
We can't use our power like this either.

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:07.830
We just have to wait for Mina
to find the password.

00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:16.260
What are you doing?

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:19.010
B-Boss!

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:25.140
Mina, we might be in trouble.

00:09:26.270 --> 00:09:30.230
Um, I wanted to confirm
if our medicines were stocked.

00:09:31.610 --> 00:09:34.740
So? Did you confirm that they were?

00:09:35.530 --> 00:09:36.360
Yes.

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:39.700
We're out of antihypertensive drugs,
so I'll restock them.

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:41.490
What are you--

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:43.240
You can't fool me.

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:47.330
I know you're after what's in
the basement safe.

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:50.750
So I'll save you the trouble of looking.

00:09:51.130 --> 00:09:52.630
I'm sorry, Mina.

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:55.670
Betrayal is unforgivable.

00:09:56.090 --> 00:09:56.930
No way...

00:09:57.220 --> 00:09:59.930
<i>Naoki, the Halbert isn't in the safe!</i>

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:02.390
<i>He knew about our plan!</i>

00:10:02.470 --> 00:10:04.390
What? What's going on?

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:07.350
Mina!

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:14.980
T-T-Traitor.

00:10:42.970 --> 00:10:43.810
Mina!

00:10:44.350 --> 00:10:45.180
Naoki!

00:10:47.890 --> 00:10:49.100
Let's go, Marcus!

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:06.830
Naoki! No!

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:11.580
D-Death to t-t-traitors.

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:18.050
You're the one dying.

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:19.510
Marcus!

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:29.230
Nice.

00:11:31.230 --> 00:11:33.020
We need to call for rescue!

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:34.900
<i>I am the Halbert.</i>

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:37.900
<i>My host dies, but I live on.</i>

00:11:38.230 --> 00:11:40.950
<i>Now I live inside you.</i>

00:11:44.990 --> 00:11:46.410
-Naoki!
-Miki!

00:11:55.630 --> 00:11:57.130
-Naoki!
-Miki!

00:11:58.090 --> 00:11:58.920
Naoki!

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:01.300
N-No, Naoki!

00:12:01.380 --> 00:12:02.260
Miki!

00:12:08.890 --> 00:12:09.720
Naoki!

00:12:09.850 --> 00:12:13.440
Did I scare you?
Sorry, sorry. I'm fine.

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:15.100
Are you really okay?

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:16.270
Yeah.

00:12:16.810 --> 00:12:20.570
We'll contact the Shoshidai immediately.
We need them to analyze you.

00:12:20.650 --> 00:12:23.360
Wait. I'm outside, and you're here.

00:12:24.410 --> 00:12:25.950
I'm fine, really.

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:29.620
My wound's healed,
and we recovered the Halbert, sort of.

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:33.830
Please. If I go back, who knows
when we'll see each other again.

00:12:35.420 --> 00:12:37.630
If you're really okay...

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:38.590
Yes!

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:41.760
Um, okay, you two enjoy yourselves.

00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:47.800
Look at him,
being considerate like an adult.

00:12:48.430 --> 00:12:50.560
Hey, are you really okay?

00:12:50.930 --> 00:12:54.230
In addition to the Fallgon,
you're possessed by the Halbert.

00:12:54.890 --> 00:12:58.730
Two weapons at once is too much strain!

00:12:58.820 --> 00:13:00.610
You're still worried!

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:02.780
Who do you think I am?

00:13:02.860 --> 00:13:06.450
I'm Miki, the young leader candidate
with a bright future!

00:13:06.530 --> 00:13:10.870
One or two extra weapons
is no problem at all.

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:13.910
<i>Kill, kill, kill, kill.</i>

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:16.830
<i>Kill, kill, kill!</i>

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:19.420
Naoki, what's wrong?

00:13:19.790 --> 00:13:21.500
No, it's nothing.

00:13:44.490 --> 00:13:45.570
That was fun!

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:49.780
You've got too much energy, Naoki.
I'm exhausted.

00:13:50.870 --> 00:13:53.370
Sorry, sorry.
Did I get a little too excited?

00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:56.160
No, I had fun too.

00:13:56.750 --> 00:14:00.710
I never get to be with you
outside the facility.

00:14:03.630 --> 00:14:05.720
Let's have that Guinness record kiss.

00:14:12.760 --> 00:14:14.680
<i>Kill! Kill! Kill!</i>

00:14:15.430 --> 00:14:18.440
<i>Kill! Kill!</i>

00:14:19.190 --> 00:14:20.520
N-Naoki?

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:23.570
Run, Mina!

00:14:38.250 --> 00:14:39.080
Good lord!

00:14:39.620 --> 00:14:42.420
-Send Marcus Lithos immediately!
-Yes!

00:14:51.890 --> 00:14:53.510
<i>What I have seen...</i>

00:14:56.020 --> 00:14:57.930
<i>this thing has seen too.</i>

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:00.650
<i>Like it was watching over me.</i>

00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:05.270
Let's go.

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:07.490
Break's over.

00:15:10.070 --> 00:15:11.860
Naoki, where are you?

00:15:17.290 --> 00:15:19.330
Do you recognize me, Naoki?

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:38.770
Stop.

00:15:40.810 --> 00:15:42.400
Stop it, Miki!

00:15:50.650 --> 00:15:52.320
Miki, snap out of it!

00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:54.280
You're my friend, right?

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:13.050
Come here.

00:16:13.680 --> 00:16:17.640
Only I can satisfy the beast
burning inside you!

00:16:45.960 --> 00:16:48.090
This is a rare case, though.

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:51.090
It seems he hasn't completely
become a Busoma, but...

00:17:02.730 --> 00:17:04.730
This is kind of bad.

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:14.200
Are you Chrysalis too?

00:17:14.740 --> 00:17:15.570
Yes.

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:29.920
It aches.

00:17:52.940 --> 00:17:53.780
Ichijo!

00:17:57.660 --> 00:17:58.490
Come on!

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:10.170
Watch out!

00:18:18.380 --> 00:18:19.840
Stop it, Naoki!

00:18:20.970 --> 00:18:23.220
Naoki, you remember, right?

00:18:24.060 --> 00:18:26.980
It's me. And you're Naoki.

00:18:27.390 --> 00:18:29.190
The Naoki I love!

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:36.400
Naoki.

00:18:44.240 --> 00:18:45.120
Don't kill him!

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:53.590
Naoki!

00:18:54.050 --> 00:18:55.920
Hang in there, Naoki!

00:18:56.510 --> 00:18:57.340
He's...

00:19:05.060 --> 00:19:10.060
He reverted back to a human
because he hadn't fully become a Busoma,

00:19:10.140 --> 00:19:13.110
as well as a coincidence
of the fatal wound's location.

00:19:13.440 --> 00:19:14.650
I'm afraid that...

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:16.900
Even if he's put into cold sleep?

00:19:17.440 --> 00:19:19.070
That won't fix it.

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:22.620
It's impossible to remain a Chrysalis
while holding two Alma.

00:19:23.030 --> 00:19:27.450
He may become a Busoma at any moment.

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:32.500
The best thing we can do
is hurry and recover the weapon.

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:36.250
The exam results came back!

00:19:36.800 --> 00:19:40.630
You're fine!
You'll be okay if put into cold sleep!

00:19:41.800 --> 00:19:42.680
I'm glad.

00:19:43.470 --> 00:19:44.470
I'm glad.

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:51.850
I did...

00:19:53.020 --> 00:19:54.650
something awful to you.

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:57.070
I tried to hurt you.

00:19:58.360 --> 00:19:59.400
That's--

00:19:59.490 --> 00:20:02.410
I don't have the right to love you.

00:20:03.320 --> 00:20:04.530
That's not...

00:20:05.280 --> 00:20:08.290
But I can't let you go.

00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:10.710
So I'm sorry.

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:14.880
You're silly. Don't apologize.

00:20:17.550 --> 00:20:20.050
Hey, will you hear my dream?

00:20:21.090 --> 00:20:23.630
Even though I'm a Chrysalis...

00:20:24.140 --> 00:20:26.220
No, maybe because I'm a Chrysalis,

00:20:26.930 --> 00:20:29.810
I find myself wanting an average life.

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:33.600
Two kids, a boy and a girl.

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:38.360
I'll buy a house not too big or small.
Maybe even a dog, too.

00:20:39.230 --> 00:20:42.860
Sometimes I'll come home drunk
and my cute wife will get mad.

00:20:51.620 --> 00:20:53.120
So Mina...

00:20:58.540 --> 00:21:00.630
Will you marry me?
